=== COMPUTE & LATENCY [L3 hand count] (frame = 64 samples @48 kHz, 8 channels)
  tree, C reference code count (tree_filterbank.c:83-205, full 63-tap conv per push): 336 pushes/ch x 63 x 8 = 169,344 MAC/frame [L3]
    NOTE: that is the C code's count. M2 runs the tree on FIRA (fira_tfb_analyze/synthesize, m1_loopback_tdm.c), so it is NOT what M2 executes; the comparison also ignores the non-tree part of the M2 load.
  tree (efficient: polyphase + half-band zero-skip, 33 nnz): 3 x 56 x 33 x 8 = 44,352 MAC/frame [L3]
  core cycles IF run on the core, project board factor 30-50 cyc/MAC (.claude/skills/dsp-algorithm/SKILL.md:57,69; decisions_log.md:234; the 50 end is the [L4] board envelope, S7_DSP_ASSESSMENT.md:90):
  FIR  64-tap slot (type-I 63 + 1 zero): direct 32,768 MAC/frame (0.19x tree C count, 0.74x efficient tree); symmetric-folded 16,384 mult/frame; group delay 31 samples = 0.65 ms [L3]
      core cyc/frame: direct 0.98-1.64 M (0.74-1.23x budget); folded 0.49-0.82 M (0.37-0.61x budget)  [L3 MAC x 30-50 factor; FIR alone, non-FIR M2 load not included]
  FIR 128-tap slot (type-I 127 + 1 zero): direct 65,536 MAC/frame (0.39x tree C count, 1.48x efficient tree); symmetric-folded 32,768 mult/frame; group delay 63 samples = 1.31 ms [L3]
      core cyc/frame: direct 1.97-3.28 M (1.47-2.46x budget); folded 0.98-1.64 M (0.74-1.23x budget)  [L3 MAC x 30-50 factor; FIR alone, non-FIR M2 load not included]
  FIR 256-tap slot (type-I 255 + 1 zero): direct 131,072 MAC/frame (0.77x tree C count, 2.96x efficient tree); symmetric-folded 65,536 mult/frame; group delay 127 samples = 2.65 ms [L3]
      core cyc/frame: direct 3.93-6.55 M (2.95-4.92x budget); folded 1.97-3.28 M (1.47-2.46x budget)  [L3 MAC x 30-50 factor; FIR alone, non-FIR M2 load not included]
  8.51 cyc/MAC = H1 8-tap flat-int kernel (different kernel class): [L3] reference only; its low end is NOT a lower bound (precedent S7_DSP_ASSESSMENT.md:90).
  frame budget 1,333,333 cyc assumes CCLK = 1 GHz; DEC-S7-RULINGS-03: recompute from the board CCLK readback (pending). M2 today 830,903 cyc/frame [L1] incl. FIRA busy-wait.
  => 128-tap compromise on the core: marginal (folded, 30 cyc/MAC) to ~2.5x over budget (direct, 50 cyc/MAC); feasibility depends on the FIRA path [L4], needs a bench measurement.

